u too! \ud83e\udd4a\n", "short_description": "\ud83e\udd8d Welcome to Steal a Monke - Steal a Brainrot in VR \ud83e\udd8d\n\nYou are a monke. You like to steal. Buy and steal brainrots to earn big money! Rebirth and unlock crazy rewards to troll other players! Stay tuned for weekly updates!\n\n\ud83e\udd2a How to Play\n\n- Buy a brainrot \ud83e\udd64\ud83e\udd77\n- Steal brainrots from other players \ud83d\udc0a\u2708\ufe0f\n- Generate money \ud83d\udc18\ud83c\udf35\n- Rebirth for rewards \ud83d\udc38\ud83d\udede\n- Buy slaps and items to troll other players \ud83e\udd88\ud83d\udc5f\n\nRemember, other players will try to steal from you too! \ud83e\udd4a\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://auravision.xyz/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Aura Vision LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://auravision.xyz/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "24294861350204108"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 0, "nodes": []}, "baseline_offer": null, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": []}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "25434169779606587", "version": "1.1.10"}, "id": "778883124482753", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_b